OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers reach 'forgotten
OL,4,AEinstein' church goal in just four
OL,5,Aweeks
OL,6,
OL,7,FA tiny rural community has taken just
OL,8,Ffour weeks to reach its #70,000 funding
OL,9,Ftarget to buy a church with links to
OL,10,Fthe man described as "Scotland's
OL,11,Fforgotten Einstein".
OL,13,FScientist James Clerk Maxwell - whose
OL,14,Fwork paved the way for mobile phones,
OL,15,Fradio and television - is buried in the
OL,16,Fgraveyard at Parton.
OL,18,FVillagers launched an appeal to raise
OL,19,F#50,000 to buy the local kirk and
OL,20,Fanother #20,000 to keep it wind and
OL,21,Fwatertight.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
