OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers reach 'forgotten
OL,4,AEinstein' church goal in just four
OL,5,Aweeks
OL,6,
OL,7,FContributions have come in from around
OL,8,Fthe world, helping them hit their
OL,9,Ftarget in half the time required to
OL,10,Fmeet a 1 November deadline set by the
OL,11,Fcurrent owners, the Church of Scotland.
